run - timeline rendering (the trace of a run to t = 6)

#2.modes
  0 .. 1  waiting | charged
  1 .. 3  sending | charged  on time
  3 .. 4  sent | charged  on time
  4 .. 6  sent | low  on time  (held at the end)
  transitions:
    t=1 waiting -> sending (time)
    t=3 sending -> sent (time)
    t=4 charged -> low (time)
  noted:
    t=0 choice entering modes: next waiting(entry), charged(entry) (unordered; took waiting(entry) first)

#4.modes
  0 .. 1  listening
  1 .. 6  received  on accept Ping  (held at the end)
  transitions:
    t=1 listening -> received (accept Ping)
